      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            3",
