    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46MF Remuneration and allowances",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46mf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            7\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            7\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mf-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mf-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mf-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "03c7ecdb878c6b897a40be9820809c2dba4c8ae11974ec2f928048205b2d7d10"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46mf",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46MF Remuneration and allowances",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nremuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If\nno determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            7\noperation, the member is to be paid the remuneration that is\nprescribed by the regulations.\n\n(2) The National Children’s Commissioner is to be paid the\nallowances that are prescribed by the regulations.\n\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973."
    },
