    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mk",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46MK Other terms and conditions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46mk"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "The National Children’s Commissioner holds office on the terms\nand conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this\nAct that are determined by the Governor-General.",
      "skos:definition": "The National Children’s Commissioner holds office on the terms\nand conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this\nAct that are determined by the Governor-General.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mk-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3d62867534494faa51b8b4ec030fdfad90c200b2da2bf58902cbf64e44d79de9",
      "skos:note": "Terms and conditions for National Children’s Commissioner office"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46mk",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46MK Other terms and conditions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "The National Children’s Commissioner holds office on the terms\nand conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this\nAct that are determined by the Governor-General."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mk-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46mk"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46ml",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46ML National Children’s Commissioner may obtain information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46ml"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "from Commonwealth government agencies\n\n(1) If the National Children’s Commissioner has reason to believe that\na Commonwealth government agency has information or a\ndocument relevant to the performance by the Commissioner of\nfunctions under this Part, the Commissioner may give a written\nnotice to the agency requiring the agency:\n\n(a) to give the information to the Commissioner in writing\nsigned by or on behalf of the agency; or\n\n(b) to produce the document to the Commissioner.\n\n(2) The notice must state:\n\n(a) the place at which the information or document is to be given\nor produced; and\n\n(b) the time at which, or period within which, the information or\ndocument is to be given or produced.\n\n(3) The time or period stated under paragraph (2)(b) must be\nreasonable.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            9\n\n(4) A Commonwealth government agency must not, in response to a\nrequirement under this section:\n\n(a) give information in a manner that would reveal the identity of\na particular individual; or\n\n(b) produce a document that reveals the identity of a particular\nindividual;\nunless the individual has consented to the giving of the information\nor the production of the document.\n\n(5) If:\n\n(a) subsection (4) would prevent a Commonwealth government\nagency from complying with a requirement under this section\nto produce a document; and\n\n(b) the agency is able to provide a copy of the document that has\nhad deleted from it the information that would reveal the\nidentity of the individual concerned;\nthe agency must comply with the requirement by producing a copy\nwith that information deleted.\n\n(6) In this section:\nCommonwealth government agency means:\n\n(a) a Department or authority of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) a person who performs the functions of, or performs\nfunctions within, a Department or authority of the\nCommonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "from Commonwealth government agencies\n\n(1) If the National Children’s Commissioner has reason to believe that\na Commonwealth government agency has information or a\ndocument relevant to the performance by the Commissioner of\nfunctions under this Part, the Commissioner may give a written\nnotice to the agency requiring the agency:\n\n(a) to give the information to the Commissioner in writing\nsigned by or on behalf of the agency; or\n\n(b) to produce the document to the Commissioner.\n\n(2) The notice must state:\n\n(a) the place at which the information or document is to be given\nor produced; and\n\n(b) the time at which, or period within which, the information or\ndocument is to be given or produced.\n\n(3) The time or period stated under paragraph (2)(b) must be\nreasonable.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00089\n\nNational Children’s Commissioner  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Amendment (National Children’s Commissioner) Act 2012\nNo. 89, 2012            9\n\n(4) A Commonwealth government agency must not, in response to a\nrequirement under this section:\n\n(a) give information in a manner that would reveal the identity of\na particular individual; or\n\n(b) produce a document that reveals the identity of a particular\nindividual;\nunless the individual has consented to the giving of the information\nor the production of the document.\n\n(5) If:\n\n(a) subsection (4) would prevent a Commonwealth government\nagency from complying with a requirement under this section\nto produce a document; and\n\n(b) the agency is able to provide a copy of the document that has\nhad deleted from it the information that would reveal the\nidentity of the individual concerned;\nthe agency must comply with the requirement by producing a copy\nwith that information deleted.\n\n(6) In this section:\nCommonwealth government agency means:\n\n(a) a Department or authority of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) a person who performs the functions of, or performs\nfunctions within, a Department or authority of the",
