      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on giving information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Individual's identity must be protected",
      "cml:conclusionText": "No information can be given"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46ml-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46ML(5) National Children’s Commissioner may obtain information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46ml-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n\n(a) subsection (4) would prevent a Commonwealth government\nagency from complying with a requirement under this section\nto produce a document; and\n\n(b) the agency is able to provide a copy of the document that has\nhad deleted from it the information that would reveal the\nidentity of the individual concerned;\nthe agency must comply with the requirement by producing a copy\nwith that information deleted.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If:\n\n(a) subsection (4) would prevent a Commonwealth government\nagency from complying with a requirement under this section\nto produce a document; and\n\n(b) the agency is able to provide a copy of the document that has\nhad deleted from it the information that would reveal the\nidentity of the individual concerned;\nthe agency must comply with the requirement by producing a copy\nwith that information deleted.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46ml"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46ml-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012-sch-1-sec-46ml-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed51aef275557a2dddb87efe8f2921b346f0be2afc29810687c05dd27e7d6b8f",
      "skos:note": "Agency must comply with requirement by producing document with information deleted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-national-children-s-commissioner-act-2012#sch-1-sec-46ml-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46ML(5) National Children’s Commissioner may obtain information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n\n(a) subsection (4) would prevent a Commonwealth government\nagency from complying with a requirement under this section\nto produce a document; and\n\n(b) the agency is able to provide a copy of the document that has\nhad deleted from it the information that would reveal the\nidentity of the individual concerned;\nthe agency must comply with the requirement by producing a copy\nwith that information deleted."
    },
